<title>BELGIUM: BBL/Vermeulen-Raemdonck rates Dexia hold.</title>
<headline>BBL/Vermeulen-Raemdonck rates Dexia hold.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report:</p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector---Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>    Dexia		Banking   3,275*  BBL/Vermeulen-Raemdonck</p>
<p>COMMENT: Credit communal has a promising outlook. We set a target price for the share at 3,550 francs. But given the share's 22 percent rise since the initial public offering last November we rank them a hold. Preference for CLF given the present relative valuation of both arms of the group. Dexia CC currently shows a 9 percent premium on the CLF price.</p>
<p>Recommendation: HOLD. Analyst: Philippe Masset</p>
<p>(*) Date of research report: 16/1/97</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Dividend</p>
<p> 1996	  258 BFR	n/a	12.7	82.8 BFR</p>
<p> 1997	  284 BFR	n/a	11.5	90.7 BFR</p>
